  "content": {
    "problemStatement": "With an array of integers arr, find the sum of `min(b)`, where `b` ranges over every (contiguous) subarray of `arr`. Since the answer may be large, output the answer **modulo** `109 + 7`.\n\n**Example 1:**\n\n```\nInput: arr = [3,1,2,4]\nOutput: 17\nExplanation: \nSubarrays are [3], [1], [2], [4], [3,1], [1,2], [2,4], [3,1,2], [1,2,4], [3,1,2,4]. \nMinimums are 3, 1, 2, 4, 1, 1, 2, 1, 1, 1.\nSum is 17.\n```\n\n**Example 2:**\n\n```\nInput: arr = [11,81,94,43,3]\nOutput: 444\n```\n\n**Constraints:**\n\n* `1 <= arr.length <= 3 * 104`\n* `1 <= arr[i] <= 3 * 104`",
    "constraints": [
      "None"
    ],
    "inputFormat": "Single line: JSON array of all arguments, e.g. [arg1, arg2, ...]",
    "outputFormat": "Single line: JSON-serialised return value",
